# File Locations

## Directory Structure

```
ElectricalDiagramAnalyzer/
├── AnvilUplinkCode/           # Anvil Uplink server (main entry point) + alternate implementations + dated backups
├── PageFilter/                # PDF page filtering (keep electrical pages)
├── VisualDetectionToolLibrary/# Heuristic panel/table detection
├── MLTableDetection/          # ML-based table detection and page classification
├── OcrLibrary/                # OCR pipeline (analyzer, header parser, table parser)
├── AnchoringClasses/          # Header/footer anchor detection
├── RulesEngine/               # Part number selection rules (engine versions)
├── PartNumberSelector/        # Equipment part number lookup tables
├── WorkerSetup/               # Thread-pool caps and runtime determinism for workers
├── DevEnv/                    # Development and testing scripts (SourcePdf/ is gitignored)
├── Backups/                   # Anvil UI form exports (extensionless) + server backups (.py)
├── MISC/                      # OcrRules, breaker_labels_config, requirements.txt
└── .cursor/                   # Cursor rules and skills
    ├── rules/
    │   ├── domain/            # Technology-specific rules
    │   ├── generic/           # Universal rules
    │   └── project/docs/      # Project documentation rules
    └── skills/                # Agent skills
```

Notes:
- `.vscode/` (launch.json) is gitignored and not tracked in the repo.
- `SourcePdf/` under DevEnv is gitignored (test PDFs stored locally only).

